#: ../../source/docs/modules/useralerts.rst:9 a88da84d86e947599823f52784b51b8c
msgid ""
"This module checks the currently connected firmware (ArduPilot) against the "
":ref:`User Alerts <dev:user-alerts-developer>` database and will notify if "
"any User Alerts are applicable."
msgstr ""
"此模块将当前连接的固件（ArduPilot）与 :ref:`用户告警 <dev:user-alerts-developer>` "
"数据库进行比对，并在存在适用的用户告警时进行通知。"

